<title>NETHERLANDS: DSM Q4 net profit 129 million guilders.</title>
<headline>DSM Q4 net profit 129 million guilders.</headline>
<dateline>HEERLEN, Netherlands 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fourth quarter 1996</p>
<p>(millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit incl. extraordinary items   129  vs   144</p>
<p>    Ditto per ordinary share (guilders)   4.16  vs  4.00</p>
<p>    Extraordinary items		   gain   5  vs	2 charge</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)			 2.59  vs   2.29</p>
<p>    Operating profit			     177  vs    174</p>
<p>    Financial expenses			    18  vs	9</p>
<p>    Tax						 38  vs     41</p>
<p>    Income from associates			 5  vs     22</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
